(6834403, 1028513, 53147, '<td valign="top">For me this one is "too" high key. I do enjoy high key images, but the colors here are just too washed out. I think you could have toned it back just a wee bit to allow the colors to come through a bit stronger and still hold onto the high key feel. I believe it would have made for a stronger image.</td>', 'For me this one is "too" high key. I do enjoy high key images, but the colors here are just too washed out. I think you could have toned it back just a wee bit to allow the colors to come through a bit stronger and still hold onto the high key feel. I believe it would have made for a stronger image.', '2012-08-03 12:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6834405, 1028504, 53147, '<td valign="top">Probably counts as high key and it is soft, but those two elements don''t guarantee an interesting picture. This doesn''t do a whole lot for me personally.</td>', 'Probably counts as high key and it is soft, but those two elements don''t guarantee an interesting picture. This doesn''t do a whole lot for me personally.', '2012-08-03 12:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6834407, 1028445, 53147, '<td valign="top">The soft focus and high key don''t really combine for an interesting picture here. This may sound odd, but i wish the bee wasnt there. The flower is intriguing all by itself. Love how the stem just blends away and the petals have a very pleasing feel. The bee is just kind of "meh".</td>', 'The soft focus and high key don''t really combine for an interesting picture here. This may sound odd, but i wish the bee wasnt there. The flower is intriguing all by itself. Love how the stem just blends away and the petals have a very pleasing feel. The bee is just kind of "meh".', '2012-08-03 12:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
