(6838822, 1028044, 97225, '<td valign="top">Ha, I thought I had this one - ''Jeremiah Was a Bullfrog'', right?  No, it''s apparently called ''Joy To The World'' (an altogether different song in my experience), so no guessing points for me.<br/>Lovely high-key image to illustrate that line. I''m not sure whether I see soft focus blur or just low-contrast-high-key-fade softness and that if the contrast were restored the sharpness would be too? I could be wrong, anyway, I love the shot.</td>', 'Ha, I thought I had this one - ''Jeremiah Was a Bullfrog'', right?  No, it''s apparently called ''Joy To The World'' (an altogether different song in my experience), so no guessing points for me.Lovely high-key image to illustrate that line. I''m not sure whether I see soft focus blur or just low-contrast-high-key-fade softness and that if the contrast were restored the sharpness would be too? I could be wrong, anyway, I love the shot.', '2012-08-09 22:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
